tify-center text-[12px] font-bold">✓</span><span class="text-[14px] text-ios-fg2 leading-relaxed">一键提取无水印原画视频、图集与实况照片</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 bg-ios-surface rounded-2xl px-4 py-3.5 shadow-sm"><span class="shrink-0 mt-0.5 w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-ios-tint/15 text-ios-tint flex items-center justify-center text-[12px] font-bold">✓</span><span class="text-[14px] text-ios-fg2 leading-relaxed">免费、免登录、免安装，浏览器打开即用</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 bg-ios-surface rounded-2xl px-4 py-3.5 shadow-sm"><span class="shrink-0 mt-0.5 w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-ios-tint/15 text-ios-tint flex items-center justify-center text-[12px] font-bold">✓</span><span class="text-[14px] text-ios-fg2 leading-relaxed">手机、平板、电脑全平台兼容，解析速度快</span></li></ul></section><section><h2 class="text-[20px] font-bold text-ios-fg mb-4">如何使用取影解析</h2><ol class="space-y-3"><li class="flex items-start gap-3.5 bg-ios-surface rounded-2xl px-4 py-4 shadow-sm"><span class="shrink-0 w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-ios-tint text-white flex items-center justify-center text-[14px] font-bold">1</span><div><h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-ios-fg">复制分享链接</h3><p class="text-[14px] text-ios-muted mt-1 leading-relaxed">在抖音、B 站等 App 中点击「分享」按钮，选择「复制链接」，得到一段包含链接的分享文本。</p></div></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3.5 bg-ios-surface rounded-2xl px-4 py-4 shadow-sm"><span class="shrink-0 w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-ios-tint text-white flex items-center justify-center text-[14px] font-bold">2</span><div><h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-ios-fg">粘贴到解析框</h3><p class="text-[14px] text-ios-muted mt-1 leading-relaxed">回到本页面，点击输入框的「粘贴」按钮，取影会自动从文本中识别出有效链接。</p></div></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3.5 bg-ios-surface rounded-2xl px-4 py-4 shadow-sm"><span class="shrink-0 w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-ios-tint text-white flex items-center justify-center text-[14px] font-bold">3</span><div><h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-ios-fg">一键解析下载</h3><p class="text-[14px] text-ios-muted mt-1 leading-relaxed">点击「解析」按钮，几秒内即可获取无水印的视频、图文与封面，点击下载保存到本地。</p></div></li></ol></section><section><h2 class="text-[20px] font-bold text-ios-fg mb-4">常见问题</h2><div class="space-y-2.5"><details class="group bg-ios-surface rounded-2xl px-4 py-3.5 shadow-sm"><summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer list-none text-[15px] font-medium text-ios-fg">取影 Acefetch 是免费的吗？<span class="ml-3 text-ios-muted transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 text-[18px] leading-none">+</span></summary><p class="text-[14px] text-ios-muted mt-2.5 leading-relaxed">是的，取影完全免费，没有使用次数限制，也无需注册或登录账号即可解析下载。</p></details><details class="group bg-ios-surface rounded-2xl px-4 py-3.5 shadow-sm"><summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer list-none text-[15px] font-medium text-ios-fg">取影支持哪些平台的去水印解析？<span class="ml-3 text-ios-muted transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 text-[18px] leading-none">+</span></summary><p class="text-[14px] text-ios-muted mt-2.5 leading-relaxed">目前支持抖音、哔哩哔哩、微信视频号、今日头条、豆包、即梦 AI、千问、皮皮虾、皮皮搞笑、最右等 10+ 平台，并提供聚合解析入口自动识别链接来源。</p></details><details class="group bg-ios-surface rounded-2xl px-4 py-3.5 shadow-sm"><summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer list-none text-[15px] font-medium text-ios-fg">解析出来的视频和图片有水印吗？<span class="ml-3 text-ios-muted transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 text-[18px] leading-none">+</span></summary><p class="text-[14px] text-ios-muted mt-2.5 leading-relaxed">没有。取影提取的是各平台的原始媒体源地址，下载得到的视频与图片中不含平台水印与作者 ID。</p></details><details class="group bg-ios-surface rounded-2xl px-4 py-3.5 shadow-sm"><summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer list-none text-[15px] font-medium text-ios-fg">需要安装 App 或浏览器插件吗？<span class="ml-3 text-ios-muted transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 text-[18px] leading-none">+</span></summary><p class="text-[14px] text-ios-muted mt-2.5 leading-relaxed">不需要。取影是纯网页工具，在任意现代浏览器中打开即可使用，无需安装任何客户端或插件。</p></details><details class="group bg-ios-surface rounded-2xl px-4 py-3.5 shadow-sm"><summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer list-none text-[15px] font-medium text-ios-fg">在手机上可以使用取影吗？<span class="ml-3 text-ios-muted transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 text-[18px] leading-none">+</span></summary><p class="text-[14px] text-ios-muted mt-2.5 leading-relaxed">可以。取影针对移动端做了适配，在手机浏览器中复制分享链接后粘贴解析即可，体验与电脑端一致。</p></details></div></section></div></div></main><footer class="mt-12 border-t border-ios-separator/60 pt-8 pb-[max(1.5rem,env(safe-area-inset-bottom))]"><div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-5"><nav aria-label="支持的平台"><h2 class="text-[13px] font-semibold text-ios-fg mb-3">支持的平台解析</h2><ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-4 gap-y-2"><li><a class="text-[13px] text-ios-tint hover:underline" href="/douyin">抖音视频去水印</a></li><li><a class="text-[13px] text-ios-tint hover:underline" href="/xiaohongshu">小红书视频图文去水印</a></li><li><a class="text-[13px] text-ios-tint hover:underline" href="/bilibili">哔哩哔哩（B 站）视频下载</a></li><li><a class="text-[13px] text-ios-tint hover:underline" href="/shipinhao">微信视频号视频解析下载</a></li><li><a class="text-[13px] text-ios-tint hover:underline" href="/toutiao">今日头条视频去水印</a></li><li><a class="text-[13px] text-ios-tint hover:underline" href="/doubao">豆包 AI 视频去水印</a></li><li><a class="text-[13px] text-ios-tint hover:underline" href="/jimeng">即梦 AI 视频去水印</a></li><li><a class="text-[13px] text-ios-tint hover:underline" href="/qianwen">千问 AI 图片 / 视频去水印</a></li><li><a class="text-[13px] text-ios-tint hover:underline" href="/doubao-image">豆包对话图片提取下载</a></li><li><a class="text-[13px] text-ios-tint hover:underline" href="/pipixia">皮皮虾视频去水印</a></li><li><a class="text-[13px] text-ios-tint hover:underline" href="/pipigaoxiao">皮皮搞笑视频去水印</a></li><li><a class="text-[13px] text-ios-tint hover:underline" href="/zuiyou">最右视频去水印</a></li><li><a class="text-[13px] text-ios-tint hover:underline" href="/tiktok">TikTok 视频去水印</a></li></ul></nav><p class="mt-6 text-[12px] text-ios-muted leading-relaxed">取影 Acefetch · 一站式短视频与图文无水印解析工具。数据由公开接口提供，